[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0364","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1030","title":"Squid HTTP 加速器模式 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Squid 在 HTTP 加速模式（httpd_accel_host 配置）下，当 httpd_accel_host 与 http_accel_with_proxy 参数设为 off 时，未正确启用访问控制列表（ACL），导致攻击者可绕过 ACL 限制，对目标代理服务器执行未授权操作，如端口扫描等恶意活动。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.3STABLE5 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击条件为攻击者需能访问目标 Squid 代理服务器的 HTTP 加速端口，无需身份认证即可触发。利用方式为向目标发送特制的 HTTP 请求，绕过 ACL 访问控制机制，实施未授权的网络探测或端口扫描活动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1030"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:26Z","remediation":"将 Squid 升级至 2.3STABLE5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 加速器模式下 ACL 被绕过的问题。如暂无法升级，可在 squid.conf 中禁用 httpd_accel_host 和 http_accel_with_proxy off 组合配置，或直接关闭 HTTP 加速器模式，并手动确保 access control lists 始终生效作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0362.html","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-031-01","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-029.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-066.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-097.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/197727","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6862"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0476","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1177","title":"Samsung ML-85G 打印机驱动不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"Samsung ML-85G GDI 打印机驱动中的 ml85p 组件（版本 0.2.0 之前）存在不安全临时文件创建漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时文件目录中创建符号链接，利用驱动程序创建临时文件时的竞态条件，将任意文件覆盖为目标临时文件，从而实现权限提升或系统破坏。该漏洞需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度较高，但一旦成功可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1177"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:44Z","remediation":"升级 ml85p 驱动至 0.2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复不安全临时文件创建问题。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 /tmp 目录的写权限，或使用 `umask 077` 并设置 `TMPDIR` 环境变量指向仅当前用户可写的临时目录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0284.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6845","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21001","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1177","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1177.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1177.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p38g-mxqp-p7pw/GHSA-p38g-mxqp-p7pw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1177.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1177.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0476.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0476.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0401","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1279","title":"tcpdump 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-1279是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1279"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57Z","remediation":"立即将 tcpdump 升级至 3.6_rel3 或更高版本（3.6.2 及更早版本受影响）；发行版用户可安装对应安全更新（如 Red Hat RHSA-2001:089、FreeBSD-SA-01:48、Mandrake MDKSA-2002:032、Caldera CSSA-2002-025）。临时缓解：在防火墙或抓包过滤中屏蔽 AFS Rx 相关 UDP 端口（7000–7009 等），或以 `tcpdump not udp port 7000 or 7001 or 7002 or 7003 or 7004 or 7005 or 7006 or 7007 or 7008 or 7009` 方式启动，避免解码恶意 AFS RPC 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000480","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7006.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/797201","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-032.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-089.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3065","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1279","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1279.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8305d7f6f9031873a5609178b8b2d4422836eee7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1279.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a937cff2-4864-4b52-bef6-740361ba9345.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/fe4a6dac94ff18c50a8e258d658a3df5b1f21651/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0520","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1320","title":"Network Associates PGP KeyServer 7 LDAP缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Network Associates PGP Keyserver 7.0 的 LDAP 服务组件在处理异常 BER 编码数据时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 LDAP 端口发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，降低了攻击门槛。该漏洞影响 PGP Keyserver 7.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1320"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 PGP Keyserver 至 Hotfix 2 版本（适用于 Solaris 和 Windows NT），可从 PGP 官方下载页面获取。如无法立即升级，在网络边界防火墙阻断 LDAP 端口（389/tcp、389/udp、636/tcp、636/udp）的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/l-116.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-18.html","http://www.ee.oulu.fi/research/ouspg/protos/testing/c06/ldapv3/","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/765256","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/JPLA-4WESNK","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3046","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6900","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16823","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1320.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1320","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1320.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/9f33e551f5d4c0bb4df8de596869fddfb4c874cc/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1320.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h4rv-3mh7-v9fq/GHSA-h4rv-3mh7-v9fq.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3046/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0352","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0977","title":"OpenLDAP slapd 基础编码规则拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 的 slapd 守护进程在处理 LDAP 协议请求时，对 Basic Encoding Rules (BER) 格式数据的长度字段验证存在缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标 slapd 服务发送包含无效 BER 长度字段的特制数据包，触发服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 OpenLDAP 1.x 版本 1.2.12 之前以及 2.x 版本 2.0.8 之前的所有版本，导致目录服务拒绝服务。攻击者只需能够访问 slapd 监听的网络端口即可发起利用，无需任何用户凭证或交互，成功利用后将使 slapd 进程异常终止，造成目录服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0977"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:20Z","remediation":"将 OpenLDAP 升级至 2.0.8（2.x 分支）或 1.2.12（1.x 分支），并应用官方发布的安全补丁。如暂无法升级，可在防火墙层限制对 slapd 端口（默认为 389/tcp 和 636/tcp）的外部访问，仅允许可信来源连接，以缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000417","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-18.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-068","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/935800","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-069.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1905","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-098.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3049","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1781cc6a314747dfce9d8864a3f090ef8f0a6f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0977.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0977","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0977.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qh43-w96h-9v7c/GHSA-qh43-w96h-9v7c.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/426b24561da5907e2706f7cda3b65ab75123f3ba/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0977.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-068.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0977.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f5037078-5dd7-4468-8ea9-63bbf7b32c22.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3752f6f525ece5f538643d4f66c1710bac6f959a/2001/CVE-2001-0977.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0514","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1291","title":"3Com SuperStack II PS Hub 40 弱密码保护漏洞","description":"3Com SuperStack II PS Hub 40 等设备的 Telnet 服务存在弱密码保护漏洞。该设备的 Telnet 服务器在收到错误的用户名或密码后，不会增加延迟或主动断开连接，导致远程攻击者可以通过暴力破解方式持续尝试登录凭据，直至获得有效账号密码。攻击者无需身份认证即可从网络远程发起攻击，一旦成功获取访问权限，可完全控制目标设备，造成信息泄露、网络中断等严重后果。该漏洞影响 3Com SuperStack II PS40 等系列设备，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全更新，建议用户升级固件或禁用 Telnet 服务改用 SSH。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1291"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:58Z","remediation":"建议立即在网络边界防火墙或 ACL 策略中禁止来自非信任网段的 Telnet（TCP 23）访问 3Com SuperStack II PS Hub 40 设备；若设备支持 SSH，请禁用 Telnet 并启用 SSH 管理；配置强密码策略（≥12 位含大小写数字特殊字符）并定期轮换；若设备支持 RADIUS/TACACS+ 认证，请接入集中认证并启用账号锁定策略（如 5 次失败锁定 15 分钟）；设备已停产停维，无厂商补丁可用，条件允许时请尽快更换为支持 SSHv2、具备暴力破解防护的现代网络设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196957","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3034","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6855","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21011","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1291.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1291","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1291.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1291.json","https://github.com/bb1nfosec/Information-Security-Tasks/blob/a4c21580c9d241a4b504c8bf598a4dcb04efc7d6/feeds/2026-06-07.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9qq6-6qwx-6wrm/GHSA-9qq6-6qwx-6wrm.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1291.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-307.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1291.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0471","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1142","title":"ArGoSoft FTP Server 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"ArGoSoft FTP Server 1.2.2.2 版本存在弱密码加密漏洞。该软件对用户密码采用弱加密算法存储，攻击者在获取到密码文件后，可通过逆向分析加密算法或暴力破解方式还原明文密码，进而以合法用户身份登录 FTP 服务器，获取服务器文件访问权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响运行 ArGoSoft FTP Server 1.2.2.2 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1142"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:40Z","remediation":"ArGoSoft FTP Server 1.2.2.2 使用弱加密算法存储用户密码，攻击者获取密码文件后可破解明文密码。建议立即升级到 ArGoSoft FTP Server 1.4.3.5 或更高版本（该版本修复了弱密码加密问题）；如厂商已停止维护，应迁移至 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd 等活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件，并启用强密码策略和加密传输（FTPS/SFTP）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6848.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196968","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3029","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21009","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1142.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1142","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1142.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1142.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w549-cmgx-vr3m/GHSA-w549-cmgx-vr3m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1142.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1302e813-a67b-46c5-8e7a-7c8cb0aeeddb.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0389","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1269","title":"Info-ZIP UnZip 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Info-ZIP UnZip 软件 (5.42 及更早版本) 存在文件名处理不当漏洞，攻击者可通过构造以 '/' 斜线开头的文件名压缩包，利用软件提取机制中的路径验证缺陷，将恶意文件写入系统任意位置。此漏洞主要影响 Linux/Unix 环境下的 Unzip 用户，在未经身份验证的情况下即可远程利用。攻击条件包括：目标系统安装了受影响的 Unzip 版本，且用户解压了攻击者控制的恶意压缩文件。利用方式是攻击者精心设计 ZIP 归档文件，伪装成正常压缩包，其中文件名以 '/' 开头，Unzip 在提取时会将其视为绝对路径，直接覆盖系统关键文件，导致权限提升或系统破坏。此漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，威胁等级较低，但可能导致严重的权限提升风险。Info-ZIP 团队已发布安全补丁，建议升级到 5.43 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1269"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Info-ZIP UnZip 至 5.50 或更高版本（修复了绝对路径遍历漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可使用 `unzip -q` 参数或在受限目录下解压（如 `unzip -d /safe/dir archive.zip`）限制解压目录，避免使用 root 权限解压不可信压缩包。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:138 补丁包（unzip-5.50-3 及以上），Debian/Ubuntu 用户升级至 unzip 5.52 以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1000928.1-1","http://www.info-zip.org/pub/infozip/UnZip.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1269.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1269","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1269.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1269.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mjxg-vj93-xfpq/GHSA-mjxg-vj93-xfpq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-138.nasl","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2001-1269","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1269.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-065.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1269.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0387","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1268","title":"Info-ZIP UnZip 目录遍历任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Info-ZIP UnZip 5.42 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可构造包含 \"..\" 路径序列的恶意压缩包，诱导用户解压时利用路径穿越跳出预期目录，覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞原理为解压过程未充分校验文件名路径，允许相对路径穿越。影响范围为所有使用受影响版本 UnZip 的系统，CVSS 2.1 分（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响）。攻击条件要求受害者手动解压恶意压缩包，利用方式为通过精心设计的文件名实现任意文件写入，可能导致配置文件篡改、权限提升或植入后门。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1268"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56Z","remediation":"升级 Info-ZIP UnZip 至 6.0 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级，应仅解压受信任来源的 ZIP 文件，并使用 unzip 的 -d 参数指定安全的解压目录，避免使用相对路径包含 .. 的压缩包；同时可在脚本中预先检查压缩包内文件名，拒绝包含目录遍历字符的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1000928.1-1","http://www.info-zip.org/pub/infozip/UnZip.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1268","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9d50ef4048bfe5ac7cf90df5d14c2acad810c8d/2001/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b2e2a399e8a344ad8940a24e1493b2c5ab226ca4/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-12xx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1268.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2001-1268"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0387.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0385","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1267","title":"GNU tar 目录遍历任意文件写入漏洞","description":"GNU tar 1.13.19 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可构造包含 \"..\" 路径遍历序列的恶意 tar 归档文件，诱导本地用户解压时触发路径遍历，导致任意文件被覆盖写入。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 tar 版本的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为本地用户拥有解压 tar 文件权限且被诱导解压恶意构造的归档文件。攻击者通过在 tar 文件中嵌入包含目录遍历序列（如 \"../../etc/passwd\"）的文件名，在受害者解压时突破目录限制，覆盖系统关键文件导致权限提升或系统破坏。CVSS 2.1 分值（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/部分完整性影响），建议升级至 GNU tar 1.13.20 或更高版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1267"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 GNU tar 到 1.13.20 或更高版本（如 1.14+），该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。临时缓解：使用 --no-same-owner --no-same-permissions 选项解压，避免以 root 身份解压不可信 tar 包，或使用 --strip-components=1 剥离路径前缀防止目录遍历写入任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000538","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4514","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/196445","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-47800-1","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10224.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:066","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-096.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-138.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-218.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3024","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2007/CVE-2007-4559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1267.json","https://github.com/huggingface/datasets/blob/030a3e540e8e5cc850c01b0ea3bc0db448255567/src/datasets/utils/extract.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1267","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1267.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/61e0472c274a1de596119dc07ee9549e09fe3313/2007/README.md","https://github.com/composefs/tar-rs/blob/2c19ee2fbd01a306127e027cb05a02568ccda1b3/src/entry.rs","https://github.com/allthemusicllc/atm-cli/blob/0f616f8559929a037693d3d6c3c36d8045d3aa11/docs/src/tar/entry.rs.html","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/926217721ffb9af6a599d252100d1345098455cb/gems/archive-tar-minitar/CVE-2016-10173.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1267.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0477","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1178","title":"XFree86 X11R6 xman MANPATH 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"XFree86 X11R6 3.3.2 版本中的 xman 手册浏览器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长 MANPATH 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 XFree86 X11R6 3.3.2 及更早版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1178"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:44Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.0 及以上版本，或迁移至 X.Org 替代 XFree86。如无法升级，移除 xman 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/xman）以消除本地提权风险，并限制不可信用户对系统的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0234.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3030","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6853","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21010","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1178","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g6r4-pgjx-j3v6/GHSA-g6r4-pgjx-j3v6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3030/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1178.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0477.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0403","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1322","title":"xinetd 缺省umask设置不安全导致本地用户文件读写漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.1.8 及更早版本以默认 umask 0 运行，导致通过 xinetd 启动的应用程序在未自行设置安全 umask 的情况下创建的所有文件均具有过于宽松的权限（默认 0666）。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞读取或篡改由 xinetd 下运行的服务所产生的日志文件、临时文件或其他数据文件，造成敏感信息泄露或数据完整性破坏。该漏洞影响所有使用 xinetd 作为超级服务的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。Debian、Red Hat、Mandrake 等主流发行版均已发布安全公告并修复此问题，建议用户升级 xinetd 至最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1322"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02Z","remediation":"将 xinetd 升级到 2.1.8.8p3 或更高版本，该版本将默认 umask 值从 0 更改为安全的 022，防止由 xinetd 托管的应用程序在未自行设置 umask 时创建全局可读写的文件。对于无法立即升级的系统，可在 xinetd.conf 配置文件中通过 umask 指令显式设置 umask 为 022，或在受 xinetd 托管的应用程序启动脚本中通过 umask 命令设置安全权限掩码。同时建议检查 /tmp 等目录下是否存在由 SWAT 等工具创建的可被其他用户读取或修改的敏感文件，发现后立即删除并重新设置安全权限。Debian 用户应安装 xinetd_2.1.8.8.p3-1.1 安全更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000404","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-024-01","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-063","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6657.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-055.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1469.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-075.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2826","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2001/CVE-2001-1322.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1322.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1322","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/17761d0bb7d0c679e07e3a6bd812f9ec07c3dd92/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1322.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-063.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5m73-qfh8-jmx3/GHSA-5m73-qfh8-jmx3.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a62a80fdc2396b876bbf0b9654bdb65410ca206f/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1322.md","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-063.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-055.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0368","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1141","title":"SSLeay和OpenSSL 伪随机数生成器信息泄露漏洞","description":"SSLeay 和 OpenSSL 0.9.6b 之前的伪随机数生成器（PRNG）存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可以通过获取其生成的小量伪随机数输出来推断 PRNG 的内部状态信息，进而预测未来生成的伪随机数序列。由于 SSL/TLS 协议严重依赖 PRNG 生成会话密钥、随机数等安全敏感数据，攻击者成功预测后可能导致加密通信被解密、数字签名被伪造或实施中间人攻击，从而泄露敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 SSLeay 和 OpenSSL 的应用与服务，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络中远程发起利用，OpenSSL 0.9.6b 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1141"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6b 或更高版本，替换受影响的 libcrypto 库文件；若系统存在静态链接该库的二进制文件，需重新编译这些程序。对于使用 pkgsrc 或发行版包管理的用户，安装 openssl-0.9.6b 或更新版本（如 NetBSD 的 openssl-0.9.6nb1）。升级后验证应用程序是否仍使用旧版库，必要时重启相关服务以加载新库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000418","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-065.php3?dis=8.0","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1483.html","http://www.osvdb.org/853","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-051.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3475","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195829","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3004","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-1141.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d6b11572520f1521d4afb76db3052380c5ebc3d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1141","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2001-1141.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/7ceeb61810e0d15a58a981a8bfda4eec6698f57d/references/CVE-2001-1141-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2001-1141__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/SSLeay%E5%92%8COpenSSL%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-1141).html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1141.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a0be07a6da4cc5f35c33f97113080161927c2ef2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8mjq-7p84-m68q/GHSA-8mjq-7p84-m68q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1141.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0495","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1244","title":"IRIX/Linux/Windows TCP MSS 小值拒绝服务漏洞","description":"多种 TCP 协议栈实现存在 TCP 最大分段大小（MSS）处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过将 MSS 设置为极小值并请求大量数据，迫使目标系统生成大量包含极少有效负载的小数据包，从而放大网络流量并耗尽服务器 CPU 资源，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11、Linux Kernel 2.4、Windows 2000/NT 4.0、IRIX 6.5 等多个操作系统，攻击无需认证，远程即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1244"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:53Z","remediation":"Linux 系统：升级内核至 2.4.18 及以上版本，或通过 iptables 添加规则 `iptables -A FORWARD -p tcp -m tcpmss --mss 1:500 -j DROP` 过滤异常小 MSS 的 TCP 包。Windows 系统：安装 MS02-005 安全更新或升级至 Windows XP/2003 及以上版本。HP-UX 系统：安装 PHNE_25243 补丁。IRIX 系统：升级至 6.5.13 及以上版本。在网络边界防火墙配置规则，丢弃 TCP SYN 包中 MSS 值小于 536 字节的连接请求，作为通用缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195457","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2997","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20997","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1244","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1244.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1244.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5fj-94hx-c37v/GHSA-g5fj-94hx-c37v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1244.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f14f4efa-fbea-42ec-bd3d-202c8fc1578b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/74384c0908702bccef653ea01534b2305b3a5ca4/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0444","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1045","title":"Basilix Webmail 1.0 文件泄露漏洞","description":"Basilix Webmail 1.0 存在文件泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向特定脚本发送特制的 HTTP 请求，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤，攻击者可利用路径遍历技术访问 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件，导致系统信息泄露。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码，攻击复杂度低，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1045"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-07-06T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Basilix Webmail 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到不受此漏洞影响的版本（如 1.0.4 及以上），或迁移至其他仍在维护的 Webmail 解决方案。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_rewrite）对 `basilix.php3` 的 `request_id` 参数进行输入过滤，拒绝包含 `../` 等目录遍历字符的请求，并限制 PHP `include` 路径范围为白名单目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20996","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1045","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1045.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1045.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gcm3-wfqm-j46m/GHSA-gcm3-wfqm-j46m.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/basilix_webmail.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2995/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1045.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a5